Copyright: 2026 Christopher Goes
 1998 Matthew Thomas
License: Expat and Matthew-Thomas-map
Comment: The big board's world map in Global Thermonuclear War is Matthew
 Thomas's ASCII world map, from https://asciiart.website/art/3719,
 reproduced exactly as he drew it, under the terms he gave with it.

